                    <characteristic name="Effect" id="3325-c27c-4822-7bab" hidden="false" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">While this unit is within the combat range of a friendly **Dire Wolves** or **Fell Bats** unit:
• This unit has **^^Ward (5+)^^**.
• Each time you make a successful ward roll for this unit, allocate 1 damage point to a friendly **Dire Wolves** or **Fell Bats** unit within this unit&apos;s combat range after the damage sequence for this unit has been resolved (ward rolls cannot be made for those damage points).</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
